  "schema_version": "1",
  "_comment": [
    "GST attributes of GSMA PRD NG.116 'Generic Network Slice Template', Version 10.0, October 2024",
    "(https://www.gsma.com/newsroom/wp-content/uploads//NG.116-v10.0.pdf), clause 3.4. Extracted from the",
    "document's attribute tables for ADR-023: each parameter's name, 'Measurement unit' and 'Presence' as",
    "printed. Names are kept as printed, including the document's own inconsistencies (the uplink table of",
    "3.4.31 labels its maximum parameter's table 'Averaging Window' in the PDF; the parameter text calls it",
    "'Maximum uplink throughput', which is used here). 3.4.9 Isolation level is 'FFS in GSMA NG' and has no",
    "table; 3.4.10 and 3.4.22 are Void. In v10.0 no parameter is Mandatory.",
    "Conditional parameters carry the condition as the document states it (or 'see clause' when it is long).",
    "The en dash in 'Guaranteed/Maximum Flow Bit Rate – Downlink/Uplink' is written as an ASCII hyphen."
  ],
